{"repositoryId":1396605884,"availability":"available","full":"imprint-hash/shisho","name":"shisho","description":"Find your shishō. A strategy marketplace on RYO-CHAN: strategies as rules, an hourly agent on RYO's tools, every decision replayable from its evidence.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T21:18:04Z","updated":"2026-10-16T02:34:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://shisho-rho.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://shisho-rho.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:41.775Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:41.775Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:41.775Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:41.775Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Find your shishō. Follow a strategy you can check.","A strategy marketplace for RYO-CHAN. Traders publish their strategy as exact rules. An agent runs every rule each hour on RYO-CHAN's live research tools, records each practice trade with the evidence behind it, and lets a Bull, a Bear and a Judge argue before any trade is taken. Anyone can replay any decision from its stored evidence. Followers choose the shishō whose record they trust, pay in RYO-CHAN, and tip after a good trade.","RYO-CHAN Hackathon 2026 · Track 1 · Autonomous Agents and Track 2 · Dashboards & Interfaces"],"features":["Live: (rebuilt from the agent's records every hour)","Public mirror of this repo:","Practice only. Shishō never places a real trade and never moves tokens. Payments are wallet-signed promises that settle when RYO-CHAN launches on RYO's DEX."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/imprint-hash/shisho/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dfe76bfa312adb06d30ab3578629004b3310162c716c92a91105a479bd8be54a","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.184Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.184Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Find your shishō. Follow a strate